# Direct runtime dependencies of orchestration-mcp (see pyproject.toml),
# plus services/common's own deps (-r) since this image installs common
# from local source with --no-deps and needs common's deps satisfied from
# this lockfile instead. nexus-rag-common itself is installed from local
# source, not from this file. Compiled to requirements.txt with
# `pip-compile --generate-hashes`; see issue #230.
-r ../common/requirements.in
